  "conclusion": "Variance component rankings are robust to the linear vs. logistic decomposition choice. Marginal logit ANOVA yields identical rankings for: (1) the three dominant item-related components (item_id > model:item_id > model, jointly 76.4% of total variance), and (2) all five non-item main effects (model > prompt_template > temperature > seed > ordering). Spearman \u03c1 = 1.000 across 7 major components. The MQL-1 analytical result confirms this: for balanced designs with intermediate difficulty (p\u0304 = 0.70), the logistic transform applies a constant scaling factor (1/[p\u0304(1\u2212p\u0304)]\u00b2 = 22.8), preserving all rankings exactly.",
